README
------

* Average.java:         demonstrates the calculation of the average of a 
                        number of values

* AverageArray.java:    demonstrates the calculation of the average of a 
                        number of values using an array

* MinMax.java:          demonstrates how to identify the largest and 
                        smallest values in a simple list of integer values

* SalesTax.java:        demonstrates how to calculate the sales tax for 
                        a purchase

* Total.java:           demonstrates the calculation of the total of a 
                        number of values

